      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "At O3, we’re fueled by the opportunity to create meaningful impact. We hold ourselves accountable to changing the lives and perceptions of those we serve – our team, clients, partners and local community – for the better. Each year we partner with incredible organizations whose missions align with our O3 values.",
