      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0084",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "We also created a monthly peer-to-peer program, ",
          "_key": "k0085"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0007"
          ],
          "text": "Pay it Phorward",
          "_key": "k0086"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", to provide a small monetary lift to help individuals and businesses during the COVID-19 crisis. The generous contributions we received touched the lives of the Chestnut Hill Cleaning Company and the Napper family.",
          "_key": "k0087"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k0007",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.payitphorward.org/"
        }
      ],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0088",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "In an effort to alleviate additional COVID-19 related pressures businesses were facing, the O3 Labs team created a messaging service that allows users to find out what’s open for business. Senior Experience Strategist, Josh Soldiers, constructed chat flows for each service type; free food distribution, local bars and alcohol, restaurants, and listing a business. He then designed the experience around SMS messaging, prioritized user inputs, and identified fallbacks. Josh also worked alongside Lead Engineer, Zuhib Daud, to create the optimal experience.",
          "_key": "k0089"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0090",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "We’re humbled to play our small role in committing to our community to build a better tomorrow.",
          "_key": "k0091"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
